# Alphabetize Option Lists

Catalogues that players pick from (Special Traits, Feats, Gadgets, spells, and
similar lists of named options) go in alphabetical order by name. When adding,
renaming, or moving an entry, put it in its sorted position.

- Sort case-insensitively, word by word: "Fully Animal" before "Giant",
  "Monstrous Form" before "Monstrous Weapon".
- Exception: lists that are deliberately grouped or paired, such as Common Body
  Tags grouped into weight classes, keep their grouping. Entries inside each
  group are not reordered unless the group has no intended order.
